,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["android","app-framework","cross-platform","ios","mobile","mobile-development","react","react-native"],"visibility":"public","forks":25122,"open_issues":1240,"watchers":125547,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"Not sure if this is a bug or a missing feature or a technical limitation.\r\n\r\n1. There is no way to track if a selection has been made or if the caret position has shifted, when the `TextInput` is already active (focused). This is causing an issue if we needed the caret to always be on the far right end and this action shifts the caret/selection away. There are no other callback functions being called when this event happens (do correct me if I am wrong).\r\n\r\n2. There is no way to get the current caret position/selection for the `TextInput` from any place else except for onSelectionChange, which is an issue if it is not triggered when caret actually changes (refer to 1.).","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react-native/issues/24712/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react-native/issues/24712/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":2319923337,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDIzMTk5MjMzMzc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react-native/issues/events/2319923337","actor":{"login":"react-native-bot","id":32686087,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNjg2MDg3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32686087?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/react-native-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/react-native-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/react-native-bot/followers","